    "language": "a",
    "generated_at": "2026-08-29T19:21:13.424464"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "Good morning.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 2,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 1.675,
      "duration": 1.675,
      "phoneme_count": 13
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s Wednesday.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 2,
      "start_time": 1.675,
      "end_time": 3.55,
      "duration": 1.875,
      "phoneme_count": 14
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "Today we\u2019ll find out about the inflation refund checks that New York State is mailing some taxpayers.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 3.55,
      "end_time": 10.75,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "phoneme_count": 101
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "We\u2019ll also find out what subway and bus riders will be paying starting in January.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 10.75,
      "end_time": 16.8,
      "duration": 6.05,
      "phoneme_count": 88
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "If you\u2019re one of roughly 800,000 people across New York State, a check for as much as $400 may have landed in your mailbox in the last few days.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 16.8,
      "end_time": 28.125,
      "duration": 11.325,
      "phoneme_count": 174
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "Or one may arrive in a day or so.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 9,
      "start_time": 28.125,
      "end_time": 31.075,
      "duration": 2.95,
      "phoneme_count": 35
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "If not, your name could be on one of some 7.4 million checks that haven\u2019t gone out yet.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 31.075,
      "end_time": 37.675,
      "duration": 6.6,
      "phoneme_count": 99
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "The state\u2019s Department of Taxation and Finance in Albany says the post office there can handle only 200,000 checks a day.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 21,
      "start_time": 37.675,
      "end_time": 47.4,
      "duration": 9.725,
      "phoneme_count": 134
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "The first batch went out last Thursday.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 47.4,
      "end_time": 50.45,
      "duration": 3.05,
      "phoneme_count": 40
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "The last won\u2019t be mailed until mid-November.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 50.45,
      "end_time": 54.125,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "phoneme_count": 45
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "The state calls them \u201cinflation refund checks.\u201d They are a product of the budget deal that Gov.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 54.125,
      "end_time": 61.025,
      "duration": 6.9,
      "phoneme_count": 94
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Kathy Hochul and leaders of the Assembly and the State Senate agreed to in the spring.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 61.025,
      "end_time": 67.15,
      "duration": 6.125,
      "phoneme_count": 83
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "They\u2019re aimed at middle-class taxpayers, to compensate for higher prices since the pandemic.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 67.15,
      "end_time": 73.625,
      "duration": 6.475,
      "phoneme_count": 90
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "The checks vary by income level.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 73.625,
      "end_time": 76.425,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "phoneme_count": 33
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "Here\u2019s who will get what:",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 76.425,
      "end_time": 78.675,
      "duration": 2.25,
      "phoneme_count": 25
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "For single taxpayers, $200 if they made $75,000 or less in 2023, and $150 if they made $75,000 to $150,000.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 20,
      "start_time": 78.675,
      "end_time": 94.175,
      "duration": 15.5,
      "phoneme_count": 235
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "For married couples who filed jointly, $400 if they made $150,000 or less in 2023, and $300 if they made $150,000 to $300,000.",
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 94.175,
      "end_time": 110.025,
      "duration": 15.85,
      "phoneme_count": 249
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "sentence": "Married taxpayers who file separately will receive the same income-dependent refunds as single taxpayers.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 110.025,
      "end_time": 118.05,
      "duration": 8.025,
      "phoneme_count": 108
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "sentence": "The Department of Taxation and Finance will decide what to send based on the income you claimed on your resident income tax return.",
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 118.05,
      "end_time": 127.45,
      "duration": 9.4,
      "phoneme_count": 137
    }
  ]
}